// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`generator 2.3.0: preflight-generator spec > item 5: formation year, notice confirmed, small-corporation paragraph on (snapshot) 1`] = `
[
  "REASONABLE CAUSE STATEMENT",
  "(Attached to Form 5472 / Pro Forma Form 1120 submission for tax year 2024)",
  "Reporting Corporation: Example Catchup Holdings LLC",
  "EIN: 12-3456789",
  "Foreign Owner: Alex Example (Hong Kong)",
  "I am the sole member of Example Catchup Holdings LLC. This statement explains why I did not file Form 5472 and",
  "the accompanying pro forma Form 1120 for tax year 2024 by the due date of April 15, 2025.",
  "1. Background",
  "I am a Hong Kong permanent resident. I formed Example Catchup Holdings LLC ("the Company") on November 2,",
  "2024 in Wyoming as a single-member LLC. The Company is a foreign-owned U.S. disregarded entity for U.S. federal",
  "income tax purposes. The Company's business activity is Software / SaaS / app development.",
  "2. Cause of the Delinquency",
  "I formed the LLC through an online formation service and relied on it for the state requirements.",
  "No one told me that a foreign-owned single-member LLC must file Form 5472 with a pro forma Form 1120 each",
  "year, even when it has no income.",
  "The Company had no U.S.-source income in tax year 2024, and no U.S. income tax was due or withheld for that",
  "year.",
  "The LLC is a small corporation for purposes of Treas. Reg. sec. 1.6038A-4(b)(2)(ii): it has no gross receipts, its only",
  "presence in the United States is its registered agent, and I had no knowledge of the requirements of section 6038A.",
  "I acted in good faith throughout and will respond promptly and fully to any IRS request relating to these filings.",
  "3. Filing History and Notice Status",
  "This is the LLC's first tax year. I am now filing the pro forma Form 1120 and Form 5472 for tax year 2024. I have not",
  "received any IRS notice about this return.",
  "4. Corrective Action",
  "As soon as I learned of the requirement, I took steps to file the outstanding returns for 2024 and 2025, which I am",
  "now filing together. I will file Form 5472 and the pro forma Form 1120 by the due date for each later tax year while",
  "the LLC remains in existence.",
  "Signed under penalties of perjury:",
  "________________________________________",
  "Alex Example",
  "Sole Member, Example Catchup Holdings LLC",
  "Date: ______________________",
]
`;

